UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["Both old and new debt are reported as liabilities with the $400,000 expensed immediately in the current period","The old debt is removed, new debt is reported, and the $400,000 is recognized as interest expense currently","The old debt is removed, new debt is reported, and the $400,000 is a deferred outflow amortized over the shorter life","The old debt remains reported until the escrow trust formally retires it at the scheduled maturity date"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under GASB 86 and GASB 65 paragraph 7, when debt is legally defeased through an irrevocable trust, the old debt is removed and the difference ($400,000) is reported as a deferred outflow of resources. This amount is amortized over the shorter of the remaining life of the old or new debt.
