  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): ASC 820-10-35-36 describes matrix pricing as a market approach technique that relies on a security''s relationship to benchmark quoted prices. Because AAA municipal yields are observable and adjustments are based on observable factors, the measurement is Level 2.
